--- !u!114 &233369043
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 233369038}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3467b631e38d4645ada373dba492029, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SequentialDialogueClue
  isDone: 0
  dialogueLines:
  - Hi, how are you? Are you eating well and taking care of yourself?
  - "Hi mom, yes I\u2019m doing alright. I\xB4ve had a rough couple of weeks, so
    my appetite is down, but I\xB4ll manage. How are you?"
  - "Oh! Why didn\xB4t you tell me sooner? Maybe I could've helped, why aren't you
    eating?"
  textContainer: {fileID: 234633480}
  textLinePrefab: {fileID: 5443594972303883199, guid: 52d616283bce83a479b1a57fd0464607, type: 3}
  nextButton: {fileID: 339192902}
  optionsContainer: {fileID: 31355790}
  optionAButton: {fileID: 1811826050}
  optionBButton: {fileID: 2128522567}
  optionALabel: "I don\xB4t know, with everything going on recently I\xB4ve just
    been too anxious to think about good food\u2026Doesn\xB4t the state of the world
    make you feel upset???"
  optionBLabel: "I\xB4ve been trying to make a conscious change, choosing more planet
    based protein, and I think my stomach might be upset with me\u2026 Here I am
    trying to change the world and look where it got me!"
  resultTextA: "Pfft, most of the things you read about nowadays are just twisted
    to scare us, I think you're overexaggerating! I\xB4d much rather blame all that
    vegan crap you decided to try out, how do you know it\xB4s not your rabbit food
    making you ill?"
  resultTextB: "Ah, I might suspect that the soy and beans aren\xB4t the real issue
    here\u2026 It sounds like you have a lot of thoughts and anxiety about the climate?
    I believe it\xB4s easy to blame your new habits for issues that in reality are
    so much bigger than that. You know what, let me invite you over for some good
    ol\xB4 vegan food and a long talk on how to get you out of this slump, okay?"
  resultDelay: 5
